{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇねぇ、前回の記事のNO.123\nは麻衣たんなのかな？\n(麻衣たん＝飛鳥まま)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"麻衣たんでも嬉しい、\n麻衣たんでなくても\nそれはそれで凄く嬉しい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早い話はあしゅに聞いてみる\nことだな( •ㅈ• )うんうん\nあしゅーーーー教えてくれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでね、シャキイズムのPV\nなんだけど『斉藤を探せ！』は\nLevelがめちゃめちゃ高いから\nふぁみたんにヒントを与えよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたん優しいお♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん、そんなの知ってるお♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"机に座って授業をしている\nシーンの座席はここ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/03/05/9559744/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは机が前にあって\n後ろを向いております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみに数学の教科書...w\n数学は物凄く得意ではありません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、この授業を受けているシーン\n『あたし影すら写ってなかったのよw』\nだからふぁみたんも探し出せる\nはずかないのよ(´;ω;`)おん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからシャキイズムのPV見た時は\n『あ、たんたんはこの辺かな』\nってオーラでよみとって\nください(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れちゃいやよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんと休憩中に\nたくさんの男の達に\n囲まれてしまい...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/03/05/9559744/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーレム状態に♡いやん\nハーレムハーレムハーレム♡\n( •ㅈ• )うっほほほほーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両手に花じゃなくて\n両手に花束って感じ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、日本では一夫多妻制\nだからこの人に決めたの♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/03/05/9559744/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの写真撮る時に\nめっちゃ膝を曲げてかがみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れかたん小さいからね♡おほほ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}